       <entry></entry>
       <entry>全文检索文档</entry>
      </row>

      <row>
       <entry><type>txid_snapshot</type></entry>
       <entry></entry>
       <entry>用户级事务 ID 快照（已废弃；参见 <type>pg_snapshot</type>）</entry>
      </row>

      <row>
       <entry><type>uuid</type></entry>
       <entry></entry>
       <entry>通用唯一标识符</entry>
